n    font-size: 1.8rem; /* Tamaño original */\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n  }\n\n  /* Envío Gratis en la misma línea */\n  .shipping-tag {\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    font-size: 1.8rem; /* Ajustado para que combine con el COP */\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .shipping-tag strong {\n    font-weight: 900;\n  }\n\n  /* Responsivo */\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .price-item--sale {\n      font-size: 2.9rem;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
